Gujarat, IN - 370130$a$, 'Mr Rahul Singla', 'Quotation for Dismantling of Spiral-Welded Pipe Equipment at Unit - 2 and moving to Unit - 3', $a$We acknowledge with thanks the receipt of your verbal enquiry for the above subject. We are pleased to quote our lowest offer for the same. If you require any further clarification, please feel free to contact us.$a$,
  $j$[{"desc": "QUOTATION FOR DISMANTLING OF SPIRAL-WELDED PIPE PLANT EQUIPMENT FROM UNIT - 2", "qty": "800", "unit": "MT", "note": "(approx.)\nplus or minus 10%", "rate": "4000", "lump": false, "amount": ""}, {"desc": "LOADING OF EQUIPMENT FROM UNIT - 2", "qty": "800", "unit": "MT", "note": "", "rate": "1500", "lump": false, "amount": ""}, {"desc": "UNLOADING OF EQUIPMENT AT UNIT - 3", "qty": "800", "unit": "MT", "note": "", "rate": "1500", "lump": false, "amount": ""}]$j$::jsonb, false, false, $j$["As discussed with, Mr SS Nanda out of the 800MT, there is a heavy item weighing approx. 100 MT that will require heavy cranes for dismantling. All necessary heavy cranes/trailers/trucks and required moving equipment are within MAN Industries' scope. For other items in the plant, existing EOT cranes will be utilised for dismantling without disturbance.", "Due to the height of the heavy items during dismantling, there is a possibility they may reach the top ceiling of the shed. Consequently, removing the roof (sheets, insulation, etc.) will also fall under MAN Industries' scope."]$j$::jsonb, $j$[{"label": "GSTIN", "value": "18% Extra"}, {"label": "TDS", "value": "1% Extra"}, {"label": "Payment Terms", "value": "20% Advance along with PO\n80% against fortnightly RA bills"}, {"label": "Completion Period", "value": "3 Months from the Date of Start of Work."}, {"label": "Mobilisation Period", "value": "1 Month from the Date of Issue of PO"}]$j$::jsonb, false, '[]'::jsonb, $j$["Cranes (heavy cranes or hydras, EOT cranes), trailers, trucks, manlifts and any other lifting or moving equipment.", "Oxygen, acetylene and LPG gas cylinders.", "Electrical, compressed-air and water points near the work area, one point each.", "Canteen facilities for our staff and workers.", "Gate passes for our staff and workers.", "All electrical disconnections (and reconnections, where required).", "Diesel, cotton waste and hand gloves as required.", "A first-aid facility.", "Two sets of assembly and detailed drawings.", "An office room and a storeroom near the work area for our tools and tackles.", "Any fabrication work required at site will be charged extra, as per our quotation."]$j$::jsonb, $j$["Managers, supervisors, and skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled manpower at site.", "Transport for our staff, workers, tools and tackles.", "Tools and tackles, welding machines, gas-cutting sets and similar equipment as required.", "Personal protective equipment: safety belts, helmets, vests or jackets, safety shoes and gloves.", "Workmen's Compensation (WC) policy and insurance cover for our staff and workers."]$j$::jsonb, 'S.A. Inamdar.')
on conflict (ref_no) do nothing;
